# 🛍️ Customer Segmentation using K-Means Clustering

An end-to-end machine learning project that groups customers into **6 behavioural segments** using K-Means clustering, and serves the model through an interactive **Streamlit web app** that predicts the segment of a new customer in real time.

Built as part of the **Thiranex internship program**.

