## 🎯 Problem Statement

Treating every customer the same wastes marketing budget. This project uses **unsupervised learning** to discover natural groups in customer data, based on age, income, spending and engagement, so a business can target each group with the right offers, channels and retention strategy.

---

## ✨ Key Features

- Data cleaning, feature engineering and exploratory data analysis (EDA)
- K-Means clustering with the **Elbow Method** to choose the number of clusters
- **PCA** (2D) visualization of the clusters
- Trained model and scaler saved with `joblib`
- **Streamlit app**: enter customer details, get the predicted segment and its description instantly
- App reads the expected feature names and order directly from the saved scaler, so training and prediction can never drift apart

